---
/**
 * Runs before first paint (no flash): marks JS as available and applies the reader's paused-motion choice
 * (design.md § Motion). The choice is a per-viewer convenience in localStorage; storage can throw (private mode,
 * blocked site data), so the access is guarded. There is one colour theme, Cobalt (design.md § Themes).
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  (() => {
    const root = document.documentElement;
    root.classList.add("js");
    try {
      if (localStorage.getItem("motion") === "still") root.classList.add("still");
    } catch {}
  })();
</script>
